<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><div style=""><p class="rally-rte-class-00f225fc8e1e03" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2"><strong><span class="rally-rte-class-0c8f0aae8453e">Action May Be Required</span></strong><span class="rally-rte-class-0dfeaa2989006a"><span class="rally-rte-class-0dfeaa2989006a"><span class="rally-rte-class-0b7a3094df3781"></span></span></span></font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-00f225fc8e1e03" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2"><strong><span class="rally-rte-class-0c8f0aae8453e"><br></span></strong></font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-0916fc7bf04abc" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2"><span class="rally-rte-class-0dfeaa2989006a" style=""><span class="rally-rte-class-0b172d657af5a" style="">Dear Member,</span></span><span class="rally-rte-class-0b7a3094df3781" style=""></span></font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-0916fc7bf04abc" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><span class="rally-rte-class-0dfeaa2989006a"><span class="rally-rte-class-0b172d657af5a"><font size="2"><br></font></span></span></p><p class="rally-rte-class-06399c687866b4" style=""><font size="2"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><span class="rally-rte-class-0dfeaa2989006a" style=""><span class="rally-rte-class-08fab63c0981ad" style="">The status for&nbsp;</span></span></font><font face="arial, sans-serif" style="">{!PartnerFundRequest.RecordType}</font><span class="rally-rte-class-0dfeaa2989006a" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><span class="rally-rte-class-08fab63c0981ad">&nbsp;program Activity #{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_Activity_Number__c}&nbsp; has been updated from&nbsp;</span></span></font><font face="arial, sans-serif" style="">{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_PriorValueOfStatus__c}</font><span class="rally-rte-class-0dfeaa2989006a" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><span class="rally-rte-class-08fab63c0981ad">&nbsp;to&nbsp;{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_Fund_Request_Status__c}. Click <a href="{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_PFRDetailLink__c}">here</a>&nbsp;</span><span class="rally-rte-class-0bd24be9664735">to view the activity status details and to determine if any action is required.</span></span><span class="rally-rte-class-0b7a3094df3781" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><blockquote style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><div style=""><p class="rally-rte-class-06399c687866b4" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-06399c687866b4" style=""><font size="2"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">Member :&nbsp;</span></font><font face="arial, sans-serif">{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_Ultimate_Account_Name__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p class="rally-rte-class-06399c687866b4" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">Campaign :&nbsp;</span><font face="arial, sans-serif">{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_UpdateCampaign__c}</font></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><p class="rally-rte-class-06399c687866b4" style=""><font size="2"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">Activity # :&nbsp;</span><font face="arial, sans-serif">{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_Activity_Number__c}</font></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><p class="rally-rte-class-06399c687866b4" style=""><font size="2"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">Activity Type :&nbsp;</font><font face="arial, sans-serif">{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_Activity_Types__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><p class="rally-rte-class-06399c687866b4" style=""><font size="2"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">Countries/Locations :&nbsp;</font><font face="arial, sans-serif">{!PartnerFundRequest.Core_MDF_Country_nm__c}</font></font></p></div></blockquote><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><p class="rally-rte-class-0916fc7bf04abc" style=""><span class="rally-rte-class-0d13d46715f37e"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="rally-rte-class-0916fc7bf04abc" style=""><span class="rally-rte-class-0dfeaa2989006a" style=""><font size="2"><font style=""><span class="rally-rte-class-08fab63c0981ad">Thank you,</span><br></font>{!PartnerFundRequest.RecordType}<font style="">&nbsp;Program Team</font></font></span></p></div></div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><div class="WordSection1" style="">

